cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >
  If you use this repository in your research, academic work, publications,
  teaching materials, or software projects, please cite it using the metadata
  below.
title: >
  Taxi Route Recommender: Reproduction and Engineering Enhancement of "A
  Cost-Effective Sequential Route Recommender System for Taxi Drivers"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shetye
    given-names: Rohit
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-21
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/rohitshetye20-ux/Taxi-Route-Recommender"
url: "https://github.com/rohitshetye20-ux/Taxi-Route-Recommender"
abstract: >
  This repository reproduces the Graph Convolutional Network (GCN) and Long
  Short-Term Memory (LSTM) based taxi route recommendation system presented in
  the research paper "A Cost-Effective Sequential Route Recommender System for
  Taxi Drivers". In addition to reproducing the original implementation, the
  project introduces modern software engineering practices including modular
  architecture, automated technical report generation, automated presentation
  generation, professional visualization assets, reproducible workflows, and
  comprehensive documentation.
keywords:
  - Graph Neural Networks
  - Graph Convolutional Network
  - GCN
  - LSTM
  - Deep Learning
  - Machine Learning
  - Transportation
  - Taxi Route Recommendation
  - Spatial Temporal Learning
  - TensorFlow
  - Research Reproduction
  - Software Engineering
  - Python
references:
  - type: article
    title: "A Cost-Effective Sequential Route Recommender System for Taxi Drivers"
